# Snake App Cursor Rule

Flutter game app: offline-first Snake with responsive play, local profile saves, and platform-correct controls.
Follow these standards for consistent contributions across developers and AI agents.

## Scope and stack
- App root: repository root (`lib/`, `test/`, `android/`, `ios/`, `linux/`, `macos/`, `windows/`, `web/`)
- Package ID: `chingalo.family.snake_app` · Display name: **Snake App**
- Stack: Flutter, local SQLite + SharedPreferences, audio (SFX/BGM), Provider or Riverpod
- Target layout: `lib/app/`, `lib/core/`, `lib/features/`, `lib/shared/` (see `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`)
- Product plan: `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` · UX: `docs/UX_DESIGN.md` · Theme: `docs/THEME_AND_COLORS.md`
- Skills: `.cursor/skills/snake-app-project/`, `snake-app-gameplay/`, `snake-app-offline-profile/`

## Required workflow before finishing a task
1. **Check what changed** — `git status` and `git diff`; only intentional files
2. Run `flutter analyze` — no errors
3. Run relevant `flutter test` — must pass
4. If UX/architecture/theme/icon/CI conventions changed, update matching `docs/` files
5. If this rule or skills drift from the codebase, update `.cursor/` in the same change set
6. Desktop CI lives in `.github/workflows/` — see `docs/CI.md` when changing build/release behavior

## Product constraints (do not regress)
- Offline-first: high scores and levels persist locally; no DHIS2 auth for core play
- Profile required to **save** scores/levels; play without profile is allowed
- Touch: swipe · Desktop (Linux/macOS/Windows): arrow keys
- Playground must work on phone/tablet including rotation
- SFX and background music are **separate** settings toggles
- Android updates: prefer Play Store / in-app update — not custom APK sideload for MVP
- Theme: nature-arcade greens/amber from `docs/THEME_AND_COLORS.md` — avoid purple-indigo defaults

## Architecture conventions
- Domain logic in `lib/core/services/` or feature controllers — not in widgets
- Grid metrics from layout constraints — not fixed portrait-only sizes
- Package imports: `package:snake_app/...`
- Prefer shared widgets in `lib/shared/` or `lib/core/` before one-offs
- Never commit secrets (`.env`, keystores, API keys)

## Naming
- Features: `lib/features/<feature>/`
- Tests: mirror under `test/`
- Loop indexes: descriptive names (`rowIndex`, `cellIndex`) — not bare `i`/`j`/`k`

## Pull request quality bar
- Scoped, reviewable diffs
- Tests for game logic, unlock rules, and persistence gates
- Show analyze/tests ran and `git status` reviewed
